BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tekkonkinkreet (2006)
DTSTART:20260602T020000Z
DTEND:20260602T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20260602T020000Z
UID:UeLPXWBRlV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 121 mins (2h01m)\n\nTwo kids must save the futuristi
 c Treasure City from the schemes of a sinister YAKUZA\, who wants to demol
 ish the degenerate city and replace it with a gargantuan amusement park. A
  modern cult classic – a sensitive story of brotherhood and connection i
 n a decaying world\, now beautifully remastered in 4K.\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/cinema/in-theaters/tekkonkinkreet\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Power Ballad
DTSTART:20260605T233000Z
DTEND:20260606T013500Z
DTSTAMP:20260605T233000Z
UID:iUPucjTpur
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 108 mins (1h48m)\n\nWhen Rick (Paul Rudd)\, a past-h
 is-prime wedding singer\, meets fading boy-band star Danny (Nick Jonas) du
 ring a gig\, the two bond over music and a late-night jam session. But whe
 n Danny turns one of Rick's songs into the hit that reignites his career\,
  Rick sets out to reclaim the recognition he believes he deserves—even i
 f it means risking everything he cares about. From writer-director John Ca
 rney (Sing Street\, Once)\, Power Ballad is a feel-good story about music\
 , self-respect\, friendship\, and the price of ambition.\n\nhttps://www.si
 ff.net/cinema/in-theaters/power-ballad-yr\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
